∑_{d∣n} μ(d) = {
  1, if n = 1
  0, if n > 1
}
=====================
If f and g are arithmetic functions such that

f(n) = ∑_{d∣n} g(d),

then

g(n) = ∑_{d∣n} μ(d)f(n/d)
     = ∑_{d∣n} μ(n/d)f(d).
=====================
If f and g are arithmetic functions such that

f(n) = ∏_{d∣n} g(d),

then

g(n) = ∏_{d∣n} f(n/d)^μ(d)
     = ∏_{d∣n} f(d)^μ(n/d).

